---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | WC2026 Prediction Tracker"
  description="This site is a fun project. No one involved is responsible for any losses incurred from betting or gambling based on its content."
>

  <section style="padding-top:2.5rem;max-width:680px;">

    <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Disclaimer</p>

    <h1
      style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,7vw,4rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.01em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:0.95;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;"
    >
      Just a bit<br />of fun.
    </h1>

    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--color-text);opacity:0.85;">

      <p>
        This site is a personal project built for entertainment purposes only. The predictions published here are generated by an AI model and are intended purely as a curiosity — a way of tracking how well a machine can read a football tournament in real time.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong style="color:var(--color-text);">Nothing on this site constitutes betting advice.</strong>
        Do not use these predictions to inform gambling decisions. The engine gets things wrong regularly — that is literally the point of tracking it.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you place a bet based on anything you read here and lose money, that is entirely on you. The site owner, the developers, and any AI systems involved accept no responsibility whatsoever for financial losses of any kind arising from use of this site.
      </p>

      <p>
        Gambling can be harmful. If you are concerned about your gambling, please seek help.
        In the UK: <strong style="color:var(--color-text);">GamCare</strong> at gamcare.org.uk or call 0808 8020 133 (free, 24/7).
      </p>

    </div>

    <hr class="divider" style="margin:2rem 0;" />

    <p style="font-size:0.78rem;color:var(--color-muted);line-height:1.7;">
      This site has no affiliation with FIFA, any football association, any betting operator, or any sports media organisation.
      All match data and results are logged manually from publicly available sources for the sole purpose of tracking prediction accuracy.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <a
        href="/"
        style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-accent);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.04em;"
      >
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none">
          <path d="M9 2L4 7L9 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        Back to predictions
      </a>
    </div>

  </section>

</Layout>
